{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "0f6a3d81-c925-4e57-b3a4-78d1e6f04c92"/*RetargetPose*/,
  "Description": "Transfers a pose from one skeleton to another by matching joint names (case-insensitive).\n\nRotations are transferred as deltas relative to each skeleton's rest pose, so rigs with different bone orientations and proportions stay intact. Joints without a name match keep their rest transform. TranslationScale controls how much of the source's joint translations (e.g. root motion) is applied - 0 keeps the target's rest translations.",
